<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3625] Pandasql interpreter fails to query over python interpreter dataframe</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3625</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;run below paragraphs to reproduce&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
%python

&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pandas as pd
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; numpy as np
df = pd.DataFrame(
np.array([
np.arange(0, 200),
np.random.randn(200).cumsum(),
np.random.randn(200).cumsum(),
np.random.randint(1, 3, 200)
]).transpose(),
columns=[&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;X&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Y&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Z&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Group&quot;&lt;/span&gt;])

z.show(df)&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
%python.sql
select * from df&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note that master and branch 0.8 both fail to query but errors in each case are different&lt;/p&gt;</description>
